<title>JAPAN: KDD shares down on lower earnings report.</title>
<headline>KDD shares down on lower earnings report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kokusai Denshin Denwa Co Ltd (KDD) fell in the Friday morning session, pushed down by media reports that its earnings would be lower than expected, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0156 GMT, the shares were down 800 yen at 10,600 yen on a trading volume of 75,100 shares, making it the largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>KDD is Japan's largest international telecommunications carrier.</p>
